<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Digicall says to review subscribers.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Digicall says to review subscribers.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mobile telecommunications reseller Digicall Ltd said on Wednesday a recent review of its business had identified a significant block of inactive or unviable subscribers and the company was now taking action to recover outstanding debts, bar or re-tariff these customers.</p>
</text>
